    <description>Update statuses for child assets; return Serialized assets so we can create assignment records

2026-07-30: INC3-91 Phase 3/5 - Added optional inputNotes, stamped onto each child&#39;s Status_Change_Notes__c alongside Status. Callers migrating off the legacy Asset_Assignment_Subflow_Autolaunched_Update_Status_Assigments writer pass inputNotes so the record-triggered Asset_After_Create_Assignment_on_Status_Change flow creates assignments for serialized children too. Callers that don&#39;t pass it are unaffected (blank notes = record-triggered flow stays gated off, matching prior behavior).</description>
